202	    /**
203	     * Host for comparison: {@link URI#getHost()} when present, otherwise the host
204	     * portion of the raw authority. Java leaves {@code getHost()} null for some
205	     * registry-names (e.g. underscores) and Unicode labels; those still appear in
206	     * {@link URI#getRawAuthority()}. The raw form is split on literal delimiters
